WEBVTT

00:00:00.683 --> 00:00:01.302
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.355 --> 00:00:04.637
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I’m <b>busier than</b> I was five years ago.

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:09.375
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> People are <b>more impatient</b> today <b>than</b> in the past.

00:00:11.363 --> 00:00:12.032
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:13.036 --> 00:00:15.980
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> I’m <b>less relaxed</b> this year <b>than</b> I was last year.

00:00:18.073 --> 00:00:18.860
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:23.066
<v><b>Speaker 4:</b></v> The service in this restaurant isn’t <b>as good as</b> it was.